# Renderer outputs, regenerated by running the file that writes them.
# `render.py` writes its pool frames beside itself; `beach_render.py` and the
# evidence drivers write into `evidence/`, which carries its own rule. Neither
# is source. A blanket `git add -A` once committed 9 MB of these into the
# sibling skill, which is why the rule lives here, next to what produces them,
# rather than in the repository root.
reference-impl/pool_*.png
